{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IM8ahtbYpB1794796305.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連升五天，見近四年半高位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7118，較上個交易日上調14點子，是自2022年7月11日以來的高位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.66水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展7,002億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作。扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨回籠138億元人民幣，終止連續4天淨投放。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:45:01.725758+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T20:37:35.253080+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:38:22.604502+00:00","content_hash":"e63c8e0a6f68b534ed925e4a18d2e4d5ecd836ffad8851ab585bb26dc4f275c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:45:01.725758+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}